## Input

```css
$gap: 16px;

@media (min-width: -$) {
  .missing-name { color: red; }
}
.after-name { color: blue; }

@media (min-width: -$gap +) {
  .missing-operand { color: red; }
}
.after-operand { color: blue; }

@media (min-width: +$gap *) {
  .missing-product { color: red; }
}
.after-product { color: blue; }

